{"message":"Before you proceed, I found a better domestic option: **Lime Green Business Checking** offers a **$200 referral bonus**—$25 more than Hunter Green. Her $31,000 funding would meet its $15,000 deposit requirement within 90 days, and your four-month checking tenure meets the 90-day eligibility requirement.

To submit a Lime Green referral, use your Rho-Bank account’s secure support center and select the option to route a message to your dedicated account manager; the account manager provides the referral materials and tracks it. Make sure she receives and uses the referral materials before applying. She must be a new Rho-Bank customer, and the business must have a different primary owner from any existing Rho-Bank business account.

I haven’t submitted a referral because the available procedure requires your dedicated account manager to handle the referral materials."}
